"Aurora · project · Fix a bug · Using Claude Code + Codex                                                                          "
" 1 Skills │ 2 Who does what │ 3 Add to project │ 4 Tasks                                                                          "
"┌▶ Steps and who does them─────────────────────────────────────────────┐┌  About this step───────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│Each step of the task is one job, done by one AI tool.                ││Reproduce · the checker                                 │"
"│p gives the selected job to another tool · P uses 1, 2 or 3 tools     ││                                                        │"
"│  Step                       Job               AI tool       Skills   ││The job       The checker checks that it really works,  │"
"│▶ 1. Reproduce               checker           Codex         1 skill  ││              with tests.                               │"
"│  2. Root cause              builder           Claude Code   2 skills ││Done by       Codex                                     │"
"│  3. Fix                     builder           Claude Code   2 skills ││Also          Codex is also the reviewer; pressing p    │"
"│  4. Review                  reviewer          Codex         2 skills ││              moves those jobs too.                     │"
"│  5. Accept                  checker           Codex         1 skill  ││                                                        │"
